 },
 {
  "work_id": "w_R4HB843T82WT",
  "campo": "sinopsis.en",
  "valor": "In Bratislava, public fountains shift from immobile structures of the urban landscape to living presences capable of speaking. In this poetic exploration of sound, water guides gaze and listening through the day, between sculpture, soundscape, and speculative fiction, and what the city has ceased to hear begins to emerge.",
